  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "AMO 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Basket of Ripe Fruit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "showed me: a basket of ripe fruit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What do you see, Amos?\" he asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 8:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"A basket of ripe fruit,\" I answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 8:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"The time is ripe for my people Israel; I will spare them no longer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"In that day,\" declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"the songs in the temple will turn to wailing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Many, many bodies—flung everywhere! Silence!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this, you who trample the needy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and do away with the poor of the land,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"When will the New Moon be over",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that we may sell grain,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the Sabbath be ended",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that we may market wheat?\"—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "skimping on the measure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "boosting the price",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and cheating with dishonest scales,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buying the poor with silver",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the needy for a pair of sandals,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "selling even the sweepings with the wheat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has sworn by himself, the Pride of Jacob: \"I will never forget anything they have done.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Will not the land tremble for this,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and all who live in it mourn?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The whole land will rise like the Nile;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "it will be stirred up and then sink",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like the river of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"In that day,\" declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will make the sun go down at noon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and darken the earth in broad daylight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will turn your religious festivals into mourning",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and all your singing into weeping.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will make all of you wear sackcloth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and shave your heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will make that time like mourning for an only son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the end of it like a bitter day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The days are coming,\" declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"when I will send a famine through the land—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "not a famine of food or a thirst for water,",
          "type": "text",
